  "prefLabel": "Cor 313.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cor 313.01 Purpose. The purpose of this rule is to establish an administrative procedure, through which a resident shall have a method to request a formal review of any issue related to any aspect of his or her confinement.\n\nSource. #12792, eff 5-25-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/cor100-700.html"
